      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DON HUNTER (6) has enjoyed the ideal lead-up to this race, winning his two starts off a spell in good style. Led and was too good in scoring by more than 5m last start, stretching his perfect record at this circuit and distance to five. Should be hitting his peak for finals night and looks the one to beat. DISTURBANCE (9) just keeps improving and made it three wins on the trot when he dug deep to win his semi-final last start. Draws wider but his form is strong enough to see him in the finish again. BOYSTROUS (4) led and fought well when edged out by DISTURBANCE last time and had a good winning strike rate prior. He can give a sight from this draw. TUAPEKA GOLD (3) has come from wider draws in each start of this campaign and managed to win a heat of this series here two back. He is a first four hope from the good draw. SLIP SLIDNAWAY (10) draws wide but has made a decent start to his career and is worth including.",
